    // Generates: components/gridColumns.tsx and its test   (point the output folder at the React app's src folder)
    // The shared helpers of the Columns list every React grid (REST and OData) has: the saved choice of columns (browser local storage, one list of names per grid), the rule that reads it back
    // (ChosenGridColumns.Resolve in Core), the tick-or-clear rule, the cut of a long text cell and the Columns button itself (a native details element, so it needs no library).
